  "AI-specific permissions (reading, summarization, RAG, training) are declared machine-readably in /.well-known/aicr.json and /.well-known/aicl.json. In short: reading, summarizing, quoting, and RAG with attribution are welcome; model training and commercial redistribution require contact.": "Permisaun espesífiku ba AI (lee, sumariza, RAG, treinamentu) deklaradu husi máquina bele lee iha /.well-known/aicr.json no /.well-known/aicl.json. Iha resumu: lee, sumariza, sita, no RAG ho atribuisaun mak bemvindu; treinamentu modelu no redistribuisaun komersiál presiza kontaktu.",
