  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Ezemplu kódigu, eskema JSON, no modelu polítika ne'ebé máquina bele lee mak lisensiadu iha okos Lisensa MIT sé la iha deklarasaun seluk. Ita bele instala sira iha ita-nia website rasik livremente.",
