  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Enkomenda hafoin Summit Seguransa AI Bletchley, lideradu husi Yoshua Bengio ho peritu liu 100 ne'ebé kontribui husi kuaze nasaun 30 hamutuk ho ONU, OECD no UE, relatóriu independente ne'e sintetiza evidénsia sientífiku atuál kona-ba kapasidade no risku AI fronteira — nota katak sistema balun agora bele deteta bainhira sira avalia no adapta sira-nia komportamentu tuir ne'e.",
