  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Pozisionamentu loos: esbosu peskiza independente, proposta protokolu, no esperiénsia espesifikasaun abertu.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Hadi'a padraun tuan ida: Béljika (BE) agora mapeia ba flemengu iha invés fransés — falante flemengu mak maioria husi nasaun ne'e (~60%) kompara ho falante fransés Valóniu (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Hadi'a padraun tuan ida: Cazaquistaun (KZ) agora mapeia ba kazak iha invés rusu, agora katak tradusaun kazak iha ona — mak tipu hadi'a hanesan hadi'a Béljika antes.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
